      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is exhausting to pretend, but that exhaustion is simply the cost of living in a world that hasn't yet learned to see you. The feeling of being a ghost is a valid reaction to loneliness, but it does not mean your life is over or that you don't belong. You are not a ghost haunting a life you don't belong to; you are a person who is just trying to find your place in a vast and often indifferent world.",
