    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so heavy. like, if the world is this indifferent, why bother fighting to be seen? sometimes i think maybe the void is actually more peaceful than this struggle. at least if i'm gone, the emptiness and i would finally be in the same place. does that even make sense? that just wanting to fade out feels more logical than trying to fight for a spot in a world that doesn't want me?",
